 {'citation':'Butler et al. (Nature Medicine 2025)','doi_url':'https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-03475-9','population_sample':'Intuition study N=23,004 enrolled; passive contributors and MCI cohorts reported separately','modalities':'iPhone passive app/keyboard/screen data + Apple Watch accelerometer/gyroscope and other sensors','published_features':'event-based app use, keyboard metrics, screen unlock and high-frequency 100-Hz IMU; time-aligned multimodal examples','synchronization_window':'longitudinal 12–24 months; multimodal time-aligned streams; passive adherence and bursts','cognitive_outcomes_findings':'remote brain-health/MCI framework; initial proof-of-concept models used interactive cognitive data, not passive-only efficacy','limitations':'proprietary SensorKit features; passive features not the primary MCI model in initial report','reproducibility':'inspiration and approximate app/screen/motion synchronization only'},
